ry comfortable with interacting with him as time passes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15062"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d8cf8ad0afbe98e2bff682bd20833ab7637729706f89c224fe5a9765ab0b900.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/4308083ec50f6591ca193176fe7e94dea2e69318b1299a5a8daed577ca680aa1.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"力丸 乃りこ","creatorId":"vndb:s471","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s471","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s471","name":"力丸 乃りこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21419","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c15071","characterName":"小牧 郁乃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c15071"},"originalCharacterName":"小牧 郁乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"303"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"77"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"151"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Manaka's younger sister. In To Heart 2, she has a chronic illness that keeps her in the hospital. In Another Days, she moves about outside of hospital, including in school, on a wheelchair for most of her story unlike in \"To Heart 2\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCha